{"sections":[{"id":"noi-dung","title":"Nội dung hướng dẫn","paragraphs":[],"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-195888","runs":[{"text":"The Doom Triad","bold":true},{"text":"\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-195905","runs":[{"text":"→ "},{"text":"Chapter 1.1:","bold":true},{"text":" Battleon and Empress Gravelyn are in danger due to darkness minions from the Solar Eclipse gateway, under the command of the Doom Triad ("},{"text":"/join shadowbattleon","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/shadow-battleon"},{"text":").\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-196080","runs":[{"text":"→ "},{"text":"Chapter 1.2:","bold":true},{"text":" DOOM is all around! It's in the air, comes out of the ground! But you've always had all the answers. Destroy the undead, and kill the necromancers ("},{"text":"/join camlan","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/camlan-forest"},{"text":").\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-196259","runs":[{"text":"Video "},{"text":"FULL Walkthrough","bold":true,"italic":true},{"text":": "},{"text":"Chap 1.1","href":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fjpOJKaoVRk"},{"text":" - "},{"text":"Chap 1.2","href":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cKeqJyKL-fU"},{"text":"\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-196304","runs":[{"text":"Sandsea in Darkness","bold":true},{"text":"\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-196326","runs":[{"text":"→ "},{"text":"Chapter 2.1:","bold":true},{"text":" Pharoah Zhoom is in dire need of your help. The Condemned Shadows have been spotted, the Lich Pharaoh Sek-Duat has escaped, and pure water in Temple of the Blue Lotus is being chaorrupted ("},{"text":"/join lotustomb","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/tomb-of-the-blue-lotus"},{"text":").\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-196548","runs":[{"text":"→ "},{"text":"Chapter 2.2:","bold":true},{"text":" Zhoom, Gravelyn, and allies have captured Sek-Duat, but the Condemned Shadows are engulfing Sandsea, Apophis's instrument, to regain power and claim the stolen throne ("},{"text":"/join shadowduat","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/shadow-duat"},{"text":").\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-196750","runs":[{"text":"→ "},{"text":"Chapter 2.3:","bold":true},{"text":" "},{"text":"Secrets hide in the hearts of men... and deep inside the sof the Hidden Palace of Duat ("},{"text":"/join hiddenduat","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/hidden-palace-of-duat"},{"text":")."},{"text":"\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-196873","runs":[{"text":"Video "},{"text":"FULL Walkthrough","bold":true,"italic":true},{"text":": "},{"text":"Chap 2.1","href":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ik6E58MDLtQ"},{"text":" - "},{"text":"Chap 2.2","href":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uH-TBp_1Bhs"},{"text":" - "},{"text":"Chap 2.3","href":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6n__Ye0SdAw"},{"text":"\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-196929","runs":[{"text":"Ashes Ignite\n","bold":true}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-196944","runs":[{"text":"→ "},{"text":"Chapter 3.1:","bold":true},{"text":" Secrets hide in the hearts of men... and deep inside the sof the Hidden Palace of Duat ("},{"text":"/join forgecitrinitas","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/forge-citrinitas"},{"text":").\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-197071","runs":[{"text":"→ "},{"text":"Chapter 3.2:","bold":true},{"text":" In the darkest depths of the Starship Carcossa lies a flicker of hope. The secret to defeating The Law and keeping your world from being erased is sealed within its hull ("},{"text":"/join carcossacabins","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/carcossa-cabins"},{"text":")"},{"text":"."},{"text":"\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-197280","runs":[{"text":"→ "},{"text":"Chapter 3.3:","bold":true},{"text":" Thousands of Doom Spirits sleep in the depths of the Starship Carcossa. They're an army ready to rise... if you reach them before the SunSetter and Titan of Light ("},{"text":"/join carcossacourt","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/carcossa-court"},{"text":")"},{"text":".\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-197482","runs":[{"text":"Video "},{"text":"FULL Walkthrough","bold":true,"italic":true},{"text":": "},{"text":"Chap 3.1","href":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Qs4Xr5ygRiQ"},{"text":" - "},{"text":"Chap 3.2","href":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8X1jiRQA6Xc"},{"text":" - "},{"text":"Chap 3.3","href":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Zcg2FY7Oxg8"},{"text":"\n"}]}]}],"previous":{"title":"Yokai Dragons Saga","url":"/cot-truyen/yokai-dragons-saga"},"next":{"title":"Bocklin Grove Saga","url":"/cot-truyen/bocklin-grove-saga"},"missingImageCount":4}